<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Category-based research of unverified software candidates for small agencies."><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"><title>StackPilot AI | Find your software stack</title><style>
:root{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;background:#0b1220;color:#e9f1ff}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}a{color:#7ce8c6}header,main,footer{max-width:1080px;margin:auto;padding:24px}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;min-width:0}nav a{margin-left:0}.brand{font-weight:800;font-size:22px}h1{font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,76px);line-height:1.06;max-width:820px;margin-bottom:16px}h2{font-size:32px}p{color:#b8c7dd;line-height:1.65}.hero{padding:70px 0}.accent{color:#7ce8c6}.button{background:#7ce8c6;color:#06231d;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.card,.quiz{border:1px solid #30405b;background:#152138;border-radius:18px;padding:24px}.card h3{margin-top:0}.section{margin:65px 0}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin:20px 0}label{font-weight:600}select{width:100%;background:#0b1220;color:#fff;padding:12px;border:1px solid #50617a;border-radius:8px;margin-top:8px}.result{margin-top:20px}:global(#result a){color:#7ce8c6}:global(#result a:focus-visible){outline:2px solid #7ce8c6;outline-offset:3px}:global(#result section){padding-top:14px;margin-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #30405b}.notice{padding:18px;border-left:3px solid #7ce8c6;background:#152138}footer{border-top:1px solid #30405b;color:#b8c7dd}@media(max-width:700px){.cards,.fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{padding:35px 0}header{flex-wrap:wrap}nav a{margin-left:0;margin-right:12px}}
.skip-link{position:absolute;top:-100px;left:16px;background:#7ce8c6;color:#06231d;padding:10px 16px;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px;z-index:1000;text-decoration:none}.skip-link:focus{top:16px;outline:3px solid #fff}
</style></head><body><a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a><header><div class="brand">✦ StackPilot <span class="accent">AI</span></div><nav aria-label="Site navigation"><a href="#advisor">Advisor</a><a href="#tools">Tools</a><a href="/compare/">Compare</a><a href="/tools/requirements-checklist/">Free checklist</a><a href="/tools/software-cost-calculator/">Cost calculator</a><a href="/tools/crm-seat-audit/">CRM seat audit</a><a href="/tools/seo-audit-scope/">SEO audit scope planner</a><a href="/guides/saas-total-cost-of-ownership/">SaaS cost guide</a><a href="/guides/crm-migration-checklist/">CRM migration guide</a><a href="/tools/crm-migration-readiness/">CRM migration readiness</a><a href="/guides/hosting-migration-checklist/">Hosting migration guide</a><a href="/tools/hosting-cutover-gates/">Hosting cutover assessor</a><a href="/tools/backup-restore-drill/">Backup restore drill</a><a href="/tools/hosting-hidden-costs/">Hosting hidden-cost worksheet</a><a href="/research/">Research status</a><a href="/methodology/">Methodology</a><a href="/disclosure/">Disclosure</a></nav></header><main id="main"><section class="hero"><p class="accent">Independent software guidance</p><h1>Explore software categories. <span class="accent">Verify before choosing.</span></h1><p>Explore unverified research candidates for small agencies, not personalized recommendations. Category matches are alphabetical, unranked; no paid rankings or sign-up required.</p><a class="button" href="#advisor">Explore category matches →</a><p>Compare head-to-head: <a href="/compare/hubspot-vs-pipedrive/">HubSpot vs Pipedrive</a> · <a href="/compare/semrush-vs-ahrefs/">Semrush vs Ahrefs</a> · <a href="/compare/kinsta-vs-cloudways/">Kinsta vs Cloudways</a></p><p>Want to review unused licenses before renewal? <a href="/tools/crm-seat-audit/">Audit your paid CRM seats</a> using your own counts. Billing impact remains unknown until you confirm your contract.</p></section><section class="section" id="advisor"><h2>Software stack advisor</h2><p>Choose your priority, team size, and budget. These are category-only matches, not personalized recommendations. Team size and budget do not change the results while suitability remains unverified.</p><div class="quiz"><div class="fields"><label>Priority<select id="goal"><option value="sales">Sales & CRM</option><option value="seo">SEO & marketing</option><option value="hosting">Website hosting</option></select></label><label>Team size<select id="team"><option>Solo</option><option>2–20</option><option>21+</option></select></label><label>Budget<select id="budget"><option>Minimal</option><option>Moderate</option><option>Premium</option></select></label></div><button class="button" id="recommend" type="button">Show category matches</button><div id="result" class="result" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div></div></section><section id="tools" class="section"><h2>Explore software</h2><p>Introductory product descriptions only; current pricing and features are not independently verified.</p><div class="cards">{products.map(p=><article class="card"><h3>{p.name}</h3><p>{p.description}</p><p>Editorial review pending.</p><p><a href={`/software/${p.id}/`}>View profile</a></p><a href={p.website} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Official website ↗</a></article>)}</div></section><section id="disclosure" class="section"><h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2><p class="notice">We may eventually earn commissions through approved affiliate links. This MVP currently contains no affiliate tracking links. Product recommendations are not paid placements.</p><p>The recommendation quiz processes selections in your browser; it does not submit personal data.</p></section></main><footer>© {new Date().getFullYear()} StackPilot AI (working name). Independent research. · <a href="/privacy/">Privacy notes</a> · <a href="/preview-build/">Preview build identity</a> · <a href="/tools/private-uat-worksheet/">Owner UAT worksheet</a></footer><script>
import products from '../data/products.json';
import { recommend } from '../lib/recommend.mjs';

const button = document.querySelector('#recommend');
button?.addEventListener('click', () => {
  const goal = document.querySelector('#goal').value;
  const team = document.querySelector('#team').value;
  const budget = document.querySelector('#budget').value;
  const output = document.querySelector('#result');
  if (!output) return;
  output.replaceChildren();
  const matches = recommend(products, { goal, team, budget });
  const h = document.createElement('h3');
  h.textContent = matches.length ? 'Category matches (alphabetical, unranked)' : 'No category matches yet';
  output.append(h);
  for (const { product, reasons, cautions } of matches) {
    const section = document.createElement('section');
    const title = document.createElement('h4');
    title.textContent = product.name;
    section.append(title);
    const why = document.createElement('p');
    why.textContent = 'Why it appears: ' + reasons.join(' ');
    section.append(why);
    for (const caution of cautions) {
      const note = document.createElement('p');
      note.textContent = 'Important: ' + caution;
      section.append(note);
    }
    const profileLink = document.createElement('a');
    profileLink.href = '/software/' + product.id + '/';
    profileLink.textContent = 'View ' + product.name + ' research profile';
    profileLink.style.display = 'inline-block';
    profileLink.style.marginRight = '14px';
    section.append(profileLink);

    const link = document.createElement('a');
    link.href = product.website;
    link.textContent = 'Check details at the official provider';
    link.target = '_blank';
    link.rel = 'noopener noreferrer';
    section.append(link);
    output.append(section);
  }
  const note = document.createElement('p');
  note.textContent = 'These are category matches, not suitability rankings or endorsements. Team size and budget are considered only when verified compatibility data exists. No affiliate links are active.';
  output.append(note);
});
</script></body></html>